cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "YOLOEZ: A no-code GUI application for end-to-end YOLO model development"
abstract: >-
  YOLOEZ is an open-source, cross-platform desktop application providing a
  complete no-code pipeline for developing and deploying YOLO11 computer vision
  models. It guides users through dataset labeling, model training, and
  inference through a graphical interface, supporting both bounding box object
  detection and polygon-based instance segmentation. All processing runs
  locally, with no account registration or data upload required.
